Vanessa Gezari with a <a href="http://www.sptimes.com/2007/10/28/Life/In_Liberia___Romeo_an.shtml">class in Liberia studying Romeo and Juliet</a>.<br />
<br />
Scott Barancik <a href="http://www.sptimes.com/2007/10/28/Business/Here_s_how_a_slick_la.shtml">tracks a thief</a>.<br />
<br />
What are you reading?
